# Frequency comparison across representations

Verifies an integer frequency and a decimal frequency combine representation promotion with unit scaling. The fractional kilohertz value orders above one thousand hertz and equals fifteen hundred hertz exactly.

>>> source
whole: int = 1000hz
fractional: decimal = 1.5khz
print(fractional > whole)
print(fractional == 1500hz)
print(whole < fractional)

<<< stdout
true
true
true

<<< stderr
